  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MultiDonor Trust Fund for Cofinancing of the Moldova Development Policy Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed Multi-Donor Trust Fund (MDTF) will provide co-financi under the series of DPOs to support the Government&apos;s program. The MDTF will allow donor contributions to be received and co-financing grant support provided over the course of this DPO series. The DPO&apos;s objectives are to (i) mitigate the impact of the war in Ukraine on refugees and households; and (ii) build resilience and enhance competitiveness to reduce vulnerabilities to future shocks. The first DPO in the series of two operations will support Moldova&apos;s efforts to respond to unprecedented challenges, while maintaining momentum on the long-term agenda of building resilience and enhancing competitiveness.</narrative>
  </description>
